# ===== Talking-shot avatar routing (Topview-class architecture) =====
# A person speaking to camera is rendered by an audio-driven avatar model (portrait/keyframe image
# + TTS voiceover -> lip-sync + expression + gesture). General video models keep b-roll/action.
ATLASCLOUD_AVATAR_MODEL=bytedance/avatar-omni-human-v1.5
ATLASCLOUD_TTS_MODEL=elevenlabs/v3/text-to-speech
# Multilingual voices (support Vietnamese): Bella, Charlie, Liam, Jessica
ATLASCLOUD_TTS_VOICE=Jessica
